WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:06.548
Should we call the police?

2
00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:07.925
No.

3
00:00:09.301 --> 00:00:10.719
My family.

4
00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:13.680
and the police only mix when they're arresting us.

5
00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:17.476
We need to find out where Russell's hiding.

6
00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:28.320
Tell me where Russell is.

7
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.030
and I will let you live.

8
00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:35.702
I have no idea Master Ethan.

9
00:00:38.997 --> 00:00:42.084
Your boss isn't here anymore

10
00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:46.046
Loyalty to him is no longer a survival trait

11
00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:51.718
I work for the true heir of the. Volchoski house

12
00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:57.474
Not a traitor who tries to steals his brother's
fortune

13
00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.646
See,

14
00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:05.524
I'm also loyal to the true heir..

15
00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:07.901
Let's see who's right?

16
00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:12.072
Alright, stop!

17
00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:17.744
Russell has a condo in a suburb nearby.
